            <ArticleTitle>The role of stress in the development of herpes zoster and postherpetic neuralgia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>7-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic pain is a multidimensional experience produced by multiple influences. This article examines the intervening role of psychologic and physiologic stress in the development and pathogenesis of prolonged herpes zoster and postherpetic neuralgia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
